WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:51.650
Kiss me.

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:52.490
Kiss?

00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:03.130
Prove to me that
you don't love Tsukushi anymore.

00:02:18.010 --> 00:02:21.520
When you're with me, you're always
thinking about something else.

00:02:22.080 --> 00:02:25.890
It's rude to make me feel
so insecure.

00:02:30.260 --> 00:02:33.130
If she means nothing to you,
you can kiss me, can't you?

00:02:42.370 --> 00:02:43.370
Close your eyes.

00:03:26.210 --> 00:03:35.050
"Surprise! A Double Date!"

00:03:57.610 --> 00:03:59.740
That was an unusual sight.

00:04:12.390 --> 00:04:14.690
<i>Oh no... My heart's pounding.</i>

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:22.970
Shocked?

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:29.940
Shocked?! Who, me?
Why should I be shocked?

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:36.590
Isn't it great? It's like Christmas
and New Year's at the same time...

00:04:37.980 --> 00:04:41.150
Like when man first landed
on the moon...

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:46.430
Nothing but joy and happiness...
That's how I feel!

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:48.860
Oh?

00:04:53.500 --> 00:04:54.340
W-what?

00:04:54.960 --> 00:04:57.780
You ramble when you're shaken up.

00:04:59.870 --> 00:05:00.560
And...

00:05:00.560 --> 00:05:01.540
Moron!

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:08.560
Instead of sharpening
your people skills,

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:10.450
you should attend more
of your classes!

00:05:13.550 --> 00:05:15.290
Hey! You're forgetting...

00:05:24.490 --> 00:05:26.360
She sure is funny.

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:34.230
<i>That Rui Hanazawa!</i>

00:05:34.570 --> 00:05:36.840
<i>How dare he act like he can read
my every thought!</i>

00:05:55.150 --> 00:05:57.020
<i>He pulled her hips to him...</i>

00:06:15.840 --> 00:06:20.510
<i>I don't care about Makino.
You're the only one for me, baby.</i>

00:06:25.880 --> 00:06:30.260
<i>To think I thought I loved that pauper!
I was a fool, honey.</i>

00:06:31.060 --> 00:06:34.130
<i>Honey... Honey...</i>

00:06:34.930 --> 00:06:38.100
<i>Honey... Honey...</i>

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:49.210
<i>That's perfectly fine with me.
Everything's A-okay.</i>

00:06:54.510 --> 00:06:55.360
<i>Still!</i>

00:06:56.350 --> 00:06:58.360
<i>That's all I was to him?</i>

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:06.090
<i>Damn! To think I actually believed him!</i>

00:07:10.790 --> 00:07:12.760
Makino's finally snapped.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:15.280
It's probably because Domyoji's
got a girlfriend.

00:07:18.100 --> 00:07:21.550
Domyoji was just toying with her
from the start.

00:07:21.810 --> 00:07:22.910
How stupid!

00:07:23.810 --> 00:07:27.340
Say, Asai... Yamano...

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:33.300
Don't you think this broken pencil
can become a weapon?

00:07:34.650 --> 00:07:35.830
Should I stab you and find out?

00:07:47.000 --> 00:07:48.630
What scaredy-cats!

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:52.520
Tsukushi... What's wrong?
Did something happen?

00:07:52.520 --> 00:07:54.070
Oh, Makiko!

00:07:54.970 --> 00:07:58.290
It's nothing. I was just
chasing off some shrews.

00:07:58.710 --> 00:07:59.680
Oh...

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:03.660
Uh, Hanazawa just gave me this...

00:08:03.880 --> 00:08:05.550
Oh! I forgot about that!

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:30.960
Tsukushi, what's wrong?
Your forehead's all furrowed.

00:08:31.640 --> 00:08:32.510
Really?

00:08:32.510 --> 00:08:35.180
Really... Has something happened?

00:08:38.580 --> 00:08:42.400
I'm just fed up with my stupidity.

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:45.890
I've always been so gullible.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:49.230
I always find out too late
that I've been fooled.

00:08:49.230 --> 00:08:53.210
What do you mean?!
That's why you're so wonderful, Tsukushi!

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:57.320
That's why everyone likes you.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:08:58.600
Really?

00:08:59.570 --> 00:09:03.990
Of course!
That's what I like about you.

00:09:06.570 --> 00:09:07.940
Really?

00:09:09.810 --> 00:09:11.000
Absolutely!

00:09:12.780 --> 00:09:14.730
That's what makes me
like you so much!

00:09:15.150 --> 00:09:16.350
That's right!

00:09:16.820 --> 00:09:19.520
I just have to be careful
not to be fooled where it counts!

00:09:20.990 --> 00:09:24.190
I feel like I've got
a second chance at life.

00:09:24.890 --> 00:09:28.930
In a way, it's like all my problems
have been solved...

00:09:30.630 --> 00:09:32.380
Uh... Tsukushi?

00:09:32.700 --> 00:09:33.400
Kazuya!

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.430
Yes?

00:09:39.940 --> 00:09:42.510
Thank you!
I think I'm out of my slump.

00:09:43.010 --> 00:09:44.130
Tsukushi...

00:09:44.780 --> 00:09:46.960
I'm glad you were
 there for me, Kazuya.

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:48.300
Oh, wow...

00:09:48.750 --> 00:09:50.800
Let's be friends forever!

00:09:50.800 --> 00:09:52.950
FRIENDS

00:10:02.790 --> 00:10:04.630
I'll see you tomorrow. Bye-bye!

00:10:05.860 --> 00:10:07.030
B-bye-bye...

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:13.320
<i>That's right.
I'm just back to a normal life.</i>

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:31.940
Why, you're humming!
You seem happy.

00:10:32.260 --> 00:10:34.560
Oh, Mom... Dinner's almost ready.

00:10:37.430 --> 00:10:40.120
A-here we go!

00:10:46.370 --> 00:10:49.970
Tsukushi... Things are going well
with the Domyoji boy, I hope.

00:10:49.970 --> 00:10:51.310
No. Not at all.

00:10:52.910 --> 00:10:54.710
He has a girlfriend now.

00:10:55.280 --> 00:10:57.040
What?! W-w-who is it?!

00:10:57.380 --> 00:10:58.740
Stop that, will you!

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:01.040
That girl who's been coming here
a lot lately.

00:11:07.920 --> 00:11:10.590
That little Miss Nobody from Nowhere?

00:11:11.560 --> 00:11:12.900
Miss Nobody?

00:11:13.200 --> 00:11:16.470
She's the heiress to
the Okawahara Group!

00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:21.730
Okawahara Group...
<i>That</i> Okawahara Group?!

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.070
That's right.

00:11:31.510 --> 00:11:34.050
We should have accepted
that 50 million yen!

00:11:37.320 --> 00:11:40.190
<i>I will determine my own destiny!</i>

00:11:40.190 --> 00:11:42.960
<i>Yes! I won't let anything defeat me!</i>

00:11:46.990 --> 00:11:50.730
What? You got fired again, Dad?

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:56.890
How can I go on the school trip, now?
I need 30,000 yen...

00:11:57.340 --> 00:12:00.400
Don't worry, Susumu.
I'm getting paid this month.

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:03.510
Really, Sis? Thank you.

00:12:06.610 --> 00:12:09.270
If we had taken that 50 million...
By now...

00:12:09.270 --> 00:12:13.510
Don't worry about that 30,000.
I'll just keep working.

00:12:19.930 --> 00:12:21.860
50 million...

00:12:23.730 --> 00:12:25.030
<i>Okay...!</i>

00:12:28.330 --> 00:12:29.470
Welcome!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.770
<i>I've got to make more money!</i>

00:13:12.110 --> 00:13:13.980
I'm beat...

00:13:14.350 --> 00:13:17.650
Yeah... It got so busy...

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.510
Yuki... You've got a test
tomorrow, right?

00:13:20.990 --> 00:13:23.980
Yeah. I'd better hurry home
and cram.

00:13:24.360 --> 00:13:25.410
Good luck!

00:13:25.410 --> 00:13:27.810
- Thanks. See you!
- See you!

00:13:27.810 --> 00:13:29.250
See you at work!

00:13:29.250 --> 00:13:30.360
Bye-bye...

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:31.960
Bye-bye...

00:13:41.440 --> 00:13:42.130
Rain?

00:14:12.840 --> 00:14:17.040
<i>I don't care about Makino.
You're the only one for me, baby.</i>

00:14:18.140 --> 00:14:22.110
<i>To think I thought I loved that pauper!
I was a fool.</i>

00:14:24.480 --> 00:14:27.760
<i>What? You got fired again, Dad?</i>

00:14:27.760 --> 00:14:30.050
<i>How can I go on the school trip?</i>

00:14:30.420 --> 00:14:34.360
<i>If we had taken that 50 million yen...
By now...</i>

00:14:34.360 --> 00:14:35.360
How about a cup of tea?

00:14:35.690 --> 00:14:36.550
<i>A pick-up artist!</i>

00:14:37.060 --> 00:14:37.760
No thanks!

00:14:40.630 --> 00:14:43.130
<i>Wait... that voice...</i>

00:14:48.370 --> 00:14:49.230
Rui Hanazawa!

00:14:56.780 --> 00:14:57.740
You startled me.

00:14:58.010 --> 00:15:00.030
<i>I</i> was the one who was startled.

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:04.450
There was this lonesome girl
walking in the rain...

00:15:05.020 --> 00:15:08.590
How rude! I was just looking for
some shelter from the rain.

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.420
That's not what it looked like.

00:15:12.030 --> 00:15:15.930
What about you?
What were you doing all alone?

00:15:17.560 --> 00:15:18.430
Taking a walk.

00:15:19.030 --> 00:15:21.430
A walk?! In the rain?

00:15:21.870 --> 00:15:24.700
I like to wander around in the rain.

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:28.440
You get wet...
That's even lonelier.

00:15:29.640 --> 00:15:31.780
I like to get wet in the rain.

00:15:32.580 --> 00:15:34.450
You like to get wet in the rain?

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:37.380
I was about to look
for a coffee shop.

00:15:37.950 --> 00:15:40.950
<i>What a weirdo!
Not that I didn't notice before...</i>

00:15:41.350 --> 00:15:43.170
What about you?
You were working?

00:15:43.170 --> 00:15:46.520
Yeah! I worked
a full five hours today!

00:15:46.930 --> 00:15:49.830
Oh, five hours? Well done.

00:15:53.170 --> 00:15:54.070
Thanks.

00:16:05.080 --> 00:16:08.310
<i>We did go on a date once...</i>

00:16:08.950 --> 00:16:11.950
<i>I wish we could have talked
as freely then.</i>

00:16:13.350 --> 00:16:13.890
What is it?

00:16:15.090 --> 00:16:16.120
N-nothing.

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:22.860
I think I can understand...
Walking in the rain...

00:16:23.560 --> 00:16:25.860
But when you step
into a nice, warm cafe...

00:16:26.300 --> 00:16:29.470
The tea's so good...
It makes you feel happy.

00:16:29.930 --> 00:16:30.740
Yeah.

00:16:34.070 --> 00:16:39.840
<i>Is it Rui Hanazawa who's changed?
Or is it me? I don't know...</i>

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:44.450
<i>But, really... I do feel happy.</i>

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:49.990
I feel like soaking in a hot spring.

00:16:50.420 --> 00:16:51.590
A hot spring?

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:55.690
You don't seem
the 'hot spring' type, at all.

00:16:56.330 --> 00:16:58.030
I like hot springs.

00:16:58.400 --> 00:17:03.170
So do I. The last time I went...
When was it now?

00:17:03.500 --> 00:17:07.170
Tsukasa, what'll you have?
I want a caf・au lait.

00:17:20.750 --> 00:17:21.420
<i>Yikes!</i>

00:17:24.220 --> 00:17:24.960
Yo!

00:17:26.020 --> 00:17:26.960
Tsukushi?

00:17:29.030 --> 00:17:31.050
Oh, what a coincidence!

00:17:31.050 --> 00:17:32.450
Yes, it is.

00:17:32.450 --> 00:17:34.330
May we sit with you?

00:17:34.330 --> 00:17:35.700
Um... I guess.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.070
Who is this? Your date?

00:17:39.500 --> 00:17:40.650
N-no!

00:17:40.650 --> 00:17:42.300
This is Rui Hanazawa.

00:17:42.300 --> 00:17:44.980
We just bumped into each other.

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:48.740
So this is Rui Hanazawa!

00:17:49.680 --> 00:17:52.750
I'm Tsukasa's girlfriend Shigeru.
Glad to meet you!

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:55.920
You sit over there, Tsukushi.

00:17:57.520 --> 00:17:59.660
Bring a chair over here, Tsukasa!

00:18:10.730 --> 00:18:13.000
<i>What's he looking so mad for?!</i>

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.510
<i>Stay calm... stay calm...</i>

00:18:18.540 --> 00:18:19.740
You're on a date?

00:18:20.240 --> 00:18:22.480
Yes. Isn't that right, Tsukasa?

00:18:23.310 --> 00:18:25.850
My, how nice to be young!

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:32.090
Why, this looks like
we're on a double date, doesn't it?

00:18:32.590 --> 00:18:33.890
That's right.

00:18:39.460 --> 00:18:41.770
Tsukasa, you look like you're
about to blow a fuse.

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:45.130
He's right.
Why are you looking so fierce?

00:18:45.130 --> 00:18:46.270
Leave me alone!

00:18:48.600 --> 00:18:51.140
Look at that! He's embarrassed!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:57.650
He kept saying, "I'm cold!
I'm sleepy! I'm going home!"

00:18:58.310 --> 00:19:01.410
I tried to book a hotel room,
and he ran like the wind!

00:19:02.150 --> 00:19:03.150
<i>A hotel room?!</i>

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:05.350
<i>Hotel?</i>

00:19:06.890 --> 00:19:09.330
<i>You're fast, Okawahara!</i>

00:19:11.490 --> 00:19:16.330
He kissed me last week,
so I figured it was about time...

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:19.800
Quit chattering, you monkey!

00:19:20.700 --> 00:19:21.810
Why not?

00:19:25.170 --> 00:19:29.750
The girl is more than willing.
Why don't you just do it?

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:35.750
Why refuse what's served up
on a platter?

00:19:36.350 --> 00:19:39.220
That's right.
Don't you think so, Tsukushi?

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:53.050
My family has a villa,
just a short drive from here.

00:19:53.050 --> 00:19:56.930
Since there's no school tomorrow,
why don't all four of us go there?

00:20:03.240 --> 00:20:05.280
<i>What in the world is she saying?</i>

00:20:05.780 --> 00:20:07.810
Come on, Tsukasa... Tsukushi...

00:20:10.180 --> 00:20:13.250
You two go ahead.
I'd hate to interfere.

00:20:13.250 --> 00:20:14.920
Isn't that right, Rui Hanazawa?

00:20:17.720 --> 00:20:19.120
Is there a hot spring
bath there?

00:20:20.660 --> 00:20:22.400
Of course! An outdoor bath!

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:23.400
Then I'll go.

00:20:25.430 --> 00:20:26.830
Rui Hanazawa!

00:20:27.530 --> 00:20:31.280
Great! Let's go.
I have a car waiting outside.

00:20:44.710 --> 00:20:47.120
<i>Why is this happening?</i>

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.030
<i>We're on the highway!</i>

00:21:05.230 --> 00:21:08.810
<i>Domyoji hasn't said a word,
and he keeps glaring at me.</i>

00:21:12.610 --> 00:21:16.640
I'm wearing some cute underwear, today.
I'm so glad!

00:21:17.480 --> 00:21:19.980
<i>Shigeru's as excited as a kid.</i>

00:21:24.750 --> 00:21:27.040
<i>And Rui Hanazawa's in
a strangely good mood.</i>

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.290
<i>Is a hot spring
that big of a deal to him?</i>

00:21:31.990 --> 00:21:36.360
<i>First that kiss... What else
am I going to be forced to watch?</i>

00:21:38.830 --> 00:21:41.370
<i>Oh, who cares, anyway!</i>

00:21:57.860 --> 00:22:04.460
Will I ever make it that far?

00:22:04.460 --> 00:22:09.210
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:22:11.030 --> 00:22:18.680
Some day, the whole world

00:22:18.680 --> 00:22:24.490
will have its eyes on me.

00:22:24.490 --> 00:22:32.240
Yeah, after our graduation ceremony

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:37.860
we all wrote our dreams on the wall.

00:22:37.860 --> 00:22:44.480
A lot of time has passed since then

00:22:44.480 --> 00:22:50.920
but I'm just the same as I was on that day!

00:22:50.920 --> 00:22:57.780
Keep trying your best! 
Wishes can come true!

00:22:57.780 --> 00:23:06.660
Let's keep running down
 the road we believe in!

00:23:07.830 --> 00:23:14.570
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:14.570 --> 00:23:20.630
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:21.170 --> 00:23:27.790
Will I ever make it that far?

00:23:27.790 --> 00:23:31.280
Yeah, I'm almost there.

00:23:31.280 --> 00:23:37.150
I already made it this far, after all.

00:23:46.690 --> 00:23:48.380
My feelings for Domyoji...

00:23:48.380 --> 00:23:53.160
...were so heavy and smothering,
that I ran away.

00:23:53.960 --> 00:23:56.880
That should have been the end of it.

00:23:57.250 --> 00:23:59.900
So why do I still feel so hurt?

00:24:00.700 --> 00:24:04.010
And he keeps glaring at me...

00:24:04.770 --> 00:24:08.940
Hana Yori Dango:
"Deep Wounds of the Heart"
